      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "誠司の自宅",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-5:caption",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "なんて話を、2人で偶然聞いちゃったワケです。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うーむ……。それは確かに、\nあやしいライブになりそうだな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "男極も散々あやしいことだらけで終わったのに、\nそれ以上になるかもって話ですからね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ただ、いろいろ考えた結果……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "私はプロデューサーに、\nライブへの参加を掛け合うつもりだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "硲 道夫"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-15:text",
        "step_id": 15,
        "step_index": 14,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 14
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もう失われたのだと思っていた挑戦の機会が、\nふたたび目の前に現れたのだから。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "硲 道夫"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……だそうです。他の人はどうします？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もちろん、俺も参加するよ！\nあの手紙へのお返しが、まだ終わってないからね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ、「全力でお前たちを叩き伏せてやるから、\n首を洗って待っていろっ！」……の手紙か。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうそう。熱い戦いが出来ると思ってたのに、\n男極が終わってガッカリしてたんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そのライブに参加して、\n今度こそ相手をして貰わないと！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_09_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_09_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 23,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "はは、そうだな。勝負を持ち掛けられたなら、\nお互いが満足するまでぶつかり合わないとな！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_09_i:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
